        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Digges Wimberly Connor\n- Organizations: National Archives and Records Administration, Congress\n- Roles: Archivist of the United States\n- Topics: Electoral College\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Digges Wimberly Connor was born on September 26, 1878.\n- Robert Digges Wimberly Connor was an American historian.\n- Robert Digges Wimberly Connor served as the first Archivist of the United States from 1934 to 1941.\n- The National Archives and Records Administration transmits Electoral College votes to Congress.\n- Robert Digges Wimberly Connor died on February 25, 1950.",
